              <section class="hub-section" id="install" data-animate="fade-up">
                <div class="hub-section-heading">
                  <h2>One command, everything.</h2>
                  <p>Runs on Ubuntu, Debian, Fedora, RHEL, Arch, and Alpine. Installs the panel, daemon, Node.js, and
                    Docker. An interactive TUI walks you through each step.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="install-block">
                  <div class="prose-code-block install-code">
                    <button class="prose-copy-btn" type="button" aria-label="Copy install command">
                      <svg width="11" height="11" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/></svg>
                      Copy
                    </button>
                    <code>curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/airlinklabs/panel/refs/heads/main/installer.sh | bash</code>
                  </div>
                  <p class="install-note">Or install panel only, daemon only, or just addons. Run with
                    <code>--help</code> for flags.
                  </p>
                  <div class="install-options"><a href="docs/deployment-guide/" class="text-link">Full deployment guide
                      <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path d="M5 12h14" />
                        <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7" />
                      </svg></a><a href="https://github.com/AirlinkLabs/panel" class="text-link">View source <svg
                        width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path d="M7 7h10v10" />
                        <path d="M7 17 17 7" />
                      </svg></a></div>
                </div>
              </section>
